  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4904.02 Form DSFM 87",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4904.02 Form DSFM 87.\n\n(a) An applicant shall supply the following on form DSFM 87:\n\n(1) The applicant’s:\n\na. Name;\n\nb. Address;\n\nc. Telephone number;\n\nd. E-mail address, if available; and\n\ne. Date of birth;\n\n(2) The employer’s:\n\na. Name;\n\nb. Address;\n\nc. Telephone number; and\n\nd. E-mail address, if available; and\n\n(3) An indication as to whether the application is an original or renewal.\n\n(b) The applicant shall sign and date the application under the penalty of unsworn falsification, pursuant to RSA 641:3.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; ss by #9766-B, eff 8-3-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
